# Trivy findings accepted on purpose. Each entry states why. Trivy reads this
# file in make image-scan, secret-scan, config-scan, CI and the security
# workflow.

# KSV-0125 (restrict images to trusted registries): the chart's only images
# are ghcr.io/schwichtgit/gitwebhookproxy (signed, verifiable with the
# optional Kyverno policy) and the digest-pinned busybox test pod. Registry
# allowlists are a cluster policy, not a chart default.
KSV-0125

# KSV-0011 (CPU not limited): no CPU limit by default to avoid CFS
# throttling of a latency-sensitive proxy; a CPU request and a memory limit
# are set. Operators can set resources.limits.cpu.
KSV-0011

# DS-0026 (no HEALTHCHECK): the runtime image is distroless with no shell or
# HTTP client. Kubernetes liveness/readiness probes on /health do this job;
# Docker HEALTHCHECK is ignored by Kubernetes.
DS-0026
